# Pre-trained model storage
# Place trained .pth and .onnx models here

# Model size presets (matching VST plugin):
#   small:  128/32/2  - Optimized for Raspberry Pi
#   medium: 256/64/2  - Laptop/Desktop
#   large:  512/128/3 - High-end systems

# Naming convention:
#   <effect>_<size>.pth   - PyTorch model
#   <effect>_<size>.json  - RTNeural export for VST
#   <effect>_<size>.onnx  - ONNX export for Pi
#
# Example:
#   models/big_muff_small.pth
#   models/big_muff_small.json
#   models/big_muff_medium.pth
